    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d434">

                <pb facs="0517" n="435" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg435"/>

                <head>Mr. Hunter to Mr. de Geofroy</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 11, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Referring to your note of the 5th instant,
                    relative to the organization alleged to be in existence within the United
                    States, having for its object the completion of an expedition to Mexico, I have
                    the honor to enclose, for your information, a copy of a communication of the 9th
                    instant from the Attorney General.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, a renewed assurance of my high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. HUNTER, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">L. de Geofroy</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d434-a1.xml" xpointer="d434-a1"/>
